# Components

- Pages in `apps/frontend/src/app`. Feature UI in `apps/frontend/src/features/*`. Primitives only in `components/ui`.
- Named exports. A feature owns its components and hooks. Share only through `src/lib`, `components/ui`, and `@saf-shekan/core`.
- Do not copy ZARVA components (`KpiGrid`, `DashboardPanel`, `DomainListPage`, `StatusBadge`, `.zarva-*`).
